<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexico has deployed 450 troops to Matamoros after a violent weekend that killed six people, including a US citizen, and has instituted a nationwide ban on cellphones in schools despite parental resistance over safety concerns. A small plane crashed shortly after takeoff, killing the pilot and co-pilot. Authorities arrested a suspect accused of killing a man in Phoenix near the California-Mexico border and also detained the mother of a 10‑year-old boy accused of fatally shooting a teen girl in Albuquerque. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOS3NqZl9NZmtSWGNlbWFwaFlzMmZiUjNEclVCV2J6eWlmUG9iclY2b0tJUXRwV05JemoxdHNXRmp6TTRYRFdrMGNiakJjQUI3ajFNc2ZJNjlxS0ZreXc1c25HOFNHNnVxSmwtdmdIV3BsTGRFeC1tZ0Q1Q2VpZ0tEME1tQWQzaEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE54RmFYMXExS0NodS1pZnNBWko5bEhIS3FPVkJvZkpPS2J2MXd6RjNqaWdOVlF6dVhsZVlDdXU5a3JLWm1WY2RjcldWMjJfNjJtNHdXS195bmJvLVFybnR1ajBwb0lJRGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;تسنیم&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNdnpHeFhIZFRDb3c0ZlpUc2MtdUtZeFctamV5MDVaa09sRUtVcmQ4NDNpUGd0TExyWUo5MDFIdzdLeWRvcGY5VFE5Q1BtcV8yd0Jsbmc3a2tob2pMOHZWWlFtZm1vSzEtZHA1NnFfWnVKZng5SG8wUEphN05Gd0VYTE5jWHZreFVjUVNaa2ppQnpwY1hDYjE2REMxSHFWSDR4OXdTZ0JXbHVqTHEzd1dTTUttTERjQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;aviationtoday.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPbFZ1SE1tNllaZkUtclh1c0lBTGRHRWZXaWJnSi0tT0JQZUNodHE4MHM4WDdZY0lHaXpLRlE1YlNObk5OOUFCal9xRUF0a1B6b2VUVTJBSFNsUVFDRnZHRlNxU2ZDNENGdXZxMGcxMWdkVVp5Q0s1OE9rUTBPNkhCaHRfa282Z3JYMEg